//! Embedded icon assets as Rune `Icon` statics.
//!
//! Ported from the gpui UI's `crates/ui/src/icons.rs` + `crates/ui/assets/icons/*.svg`.
//! Each body is the SVG inside its outer `<svg>` tag; `currentColor` works, so callers tint
//! with `.color(..)` on the element.
//!
//! Most glyphs are **Solar Icons** (Linear weight) by 480 Design, CC BY 4.0
//! (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) — attribution: "Solar Icons by 480 Design".
//! The terminal/plus/close/return/expand/fold/star/branch/bell/bot/info/caption/home/drive
//! glyphs and the harness brand marks are hand-drawn ports of hearth's inline SVGs / icons.tsx.

